  "2026-10-04T10:58:23.727Z","harness:codex","PR #1387 exact-head hosted evidence c68931ccaefc2f6566983b70bf4d6433da5887bb: every GitHub check completed successfully, including mandatory complete source coverage. Downloaded coverage-node24-ubuntu-latest from CI run37196096570 and verified every source row has zero uncovered counts: lines63521/63521, statements66631/66631, functions13763/13763, branches50966/50966. Greptile confidence5/5 reports both history findings fixed and no new actionable issue; CodeRabbit reports no actionable defect. Sourcery detailed review remains quota-limited, not an approval. Finalizing the existing build helper docstring to satisfy100 percent touched-function documentation; no executable behavior or gate is changed."
